# Local-only DashScope credential placeholder for future Qwen/DashScope work.
# Copy this file to `.env` and set the value locally only if/when that integration begins.
# This repo does not make DashScope network calls in the current slice.
# Local readiness checks stay fully redacted and report only presence/absence plus booleans.
# `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY_WORKFLOW_MANAGER` is the only active local key name today.
# Generic `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` and future model/base-url/region keys stay reserved or fallback-only until a deliberate policy update.
# The intended future Hermes/Qwen model is `qwen3.6-plus`.
# `QWEN_MODEL` is the preferred future model-selector name and `DASHSCOPE_MODEL` is the fallback-only alias, but both stay comment-only here until runtime integration is deliberately enabled.
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY_WORKFLOW_MANAGER=<set-locally>
